QuantGrad V5 — Market Intelligence Platform

QuantGrad V5 is a local-first market intelligence workspace that combines public market data, interactive trading research tools, and a three-model machine-learning decision pipeline. It is designed for research, learning, and market analysis; it does not execute trades or provide financial advice.

The project includes a React and TypeScript frontend, a FastAPI and Python inference backend, resilient public-data integrations, and a locally saved model-artifact workflow for repeatable demonstrations.


Disclaimer: QuantGrad is an academic and research project. Signals, charts, analytics, and model outputs are informational only and must not be treated as investment recommendations or a guarantee of market performance.

